# Command Points per faction

Command Points (CP) are an optional army-building currency owned by the **Codex**, not a global UI feature.

- Store the switch on `Codex.UsesCommandPoints` (`1` = track and display CP, `0` = ignore).
- Formation / Detachment `CommandPoints` columns may still exist for every army book; leave them `0` when unused.
- Only Tyranids currently set `UsesCommandPoints = 1`. New factions default to `0` unless their army book uses CP the same way.
- Army list, army detail, army builder, formation picker, and detachment summaries must show CP **only** when `UsesCommandPoints` is true.
